      "writtenOn": "2019-05-30T21:18:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we know that the format in the queue is always (timestamp, sample), could we just save the timestamp in a local and continue? Or is the guarantee just that any sample will have a timestamp right before it? Document these things :)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 296,
        "startChar": 0,
